final class ShippingQuoteProbeController extends Controller {public function __invoke(Request $request,UnifiedShippingQuoteService $service){if(app()->environment('production'))throw new AccessDeniedHttpException('Solo Stage.');$d=$request->validate(['cp_origin'=>['required','regex:/^\d{5}$/'],'cp_destination'=>['required','regex:/^\d{5}$/'],'package_type'=>'required|in:envelope,box','weight'=>'required|numeric|min:0.01|max:70','length'=>'nullable|numeric|min:1|max:300','width'=>'nullable|numeric|min:1|max:300','height'=>'nullable|numeric|min:1|max:300']);$result=$service->quote(new UnifiedQuoteRequest('estafeta',$d['cp_origin'],$d['cp_destination'],(float)$d['weight'],(float)($d['length']??1),(float)($d['width']??1),(float)($d['height']??1),$d['package_type']),'stage',true);return response()->json($result->toArray());}}
